      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_08_question_02",
      "hash64": "B20778FF66E7964F",
      "text": "２　當威力１００的水屬性招式擊中\\n　　草屬性寶可夢的要害時，威力是多少？\\n\\n・５０　　・７５\\n・１００",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
