      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_b_08_question_03",
      "hash64": "B20777FF66E7949C",
      "text": "３　一般來說，使用尖石攻擊\\n　　擊中要害的機率是多少？\\n\\n・大約１％　　・大約４％\\n・大約１２％",
